    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94708" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεπ-τέον</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέπτομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must
				reflect</i> or <i>consider</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.72
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ ταύτῃ ς. ὃ ζητοῦμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					188c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					28b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόδε, εἰ . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					3.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίς κτῆσις δικαία ἐστί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					1.3.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποῖά ποτε . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					8.39
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>An.</u>
					1.3.11
				</span></i>
			; <i>one must pay attention to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χωρίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Liqu.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεπτέος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
					<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <i>to be
				considered, examined</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀλήθεια ς. αὐτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					3.4.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
